    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nywolirok pa Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo me jacwo moro ma janono pa Benyamin onywomo dhako ma bende janono pere ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 7:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebu 11:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka dhako no ogamo iye to nywolo rigo wode. Munyo dheno oneno nger ma wode ŋon iye, okano go ma dwe adek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To munyo go k'onyalo kano wode loyo kenyo, ocweyo adita gi midole aka ofuyo iye gi gima geŋo pi donjo iye to ketho wode iy'adita no. Dheno otero nyathi no to ketho i lum midole maboyo dho thengi malawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka nyamin nyathi ocungo gi bor neno gim'otimere rigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyar Farawo obino piny lwoki i malawa, aka jotic pere oyido jowotho i thengi malawa. Nyar Farawo oneno adita i lum midole, aka ooro jatic pere kwanyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyawo aka oneno nyathi, aka neni nyathi oyido ywak. Omako wor gi nyathi to waco ni, “Me acel kwoŋ nyithindho pa Joebulaniya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo nyamin nyathi owaco ri nyar Farawo ni, “Akadhi alwoŋ acel kwoŋ mon Joebulaniya wopidi rin nyathi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyar Farawo odwoko ni, “Kadhi” Ameno nyako no okidho to lwoŋo yok nyathi won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka nyar Farawo owaco ri dheno ni, “Ter nyathi me ipidi ran, abino culin misara.” Ameno dheno otero nyathi no to pido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen munyo nyathi odongo, dheno otero go bongi nyar Farawo, m'otero go paka wode. Aka nyar Farawo ocwoko nyinge ni Musa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Musa",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nyingi jo me winjere pa wac i dhohiburu ma nyutho ywayo woko",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to waco ni, “Aywayo go woko wok i pi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa kwale kidho i Midian",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Musa otieko dongo, okidho wendo ri ji pere Joebulaniya aka oneno nger m'oyido iromo iye jo timo tic matek. Go oneno kiri munyo Jamisir neko Jayuda acel kwoŋ ji pa Musa won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa oŋiyo thenge gi thenge, aka oneno nike oyido ongoye ŋata neno go, aka oneko Jamisir to yiko delkwoŋe i kwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere Musa ogik to neno cwo ario ma Joebulaniya jogore. Aka owaco ri ŋat'oyido okom mere ni, “Raŋo igoyo Jayuda nyawotin?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalo odwoko go ni, “Ŋa m'okethin bedo jadhum kodi jathum banja? Imito nekan paka ineko Jamisir” Aka Musa obedo gi lworo to waco ni, “Adieri gime oŋeyere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Farawo owinjo gime, odwaro neko Musa. To Musa oringo aka oeye woko i waŋ Farawo to kidho i piny Midian kam'obedo piny cegin gi waŋ pi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo jacway ri Were i wi migam ma Midian oyido nitie gi nyike abirio, aka jobino jotwomo pi to jopoŋo i wer ri mwendi pa bajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jokwath rombo moro jobino to joriemo jo. Kenyo Musa oay aka okonyo jo to miyo mwendi pajo pi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jodok bongi bajo Yethiro, openjo jo ni, “Raŋo konon widwoko con?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodwoko ni, “Jamisir moro obotho wan wok i cingi jokwath rombo aka bende otwomo riwan pi ma romo to miyo mwendi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go openjo nyike pere ni, “Go nikune? Raŋo wiweyo jalo woko kenyo? Lwoŋ win go wocam mugat.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Musa oyeyo bedo kenyo, aka Yethiro omiyo go nyare m'ilwoŋo ni Zipora i nywomirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zipora onywolo ri Musa wode to cwoko nyinge ni Gerison kole owaco ni, “Abedo jawoth i piny pa jopath.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
